  "description": "Executor is a solid choice for all the Mix fleet missions, except for Mandalore.\nRazor Crest is used in a ton of Ops, but can be replaced by either Slave or Punishing for the starting line-up.\nIf a special unit is in the starting line-up, HT and RC are typically the best, but if RC is occupied, XB/Slave/Punishing takes its place.",
